#: ../../source/chapters/11-lazy-ai-coder.md:8
#: 94f2a2ac86d54f5ebb983faaa4521345
msgid "Case Study: Lazy AI Coder — A Four-Act Worked Example"
msgstr "案例研究：Lazy AI Coder —— 一则四幕剧形式的实证示例"

#: ../../source/chapters/11-lazy-ai-coder.md:10
#: 8516e93e52a34afcbc79d46b334b354d
msgid ""
"*If the framework cannot score the book's own host repository and then "
"improve it, the framework is wrong.*"
msgstr "*若这套框架连\"给本书所承载的仓库打分、再改进它\"这件事都做不了，那这框架就是错的。*"

#: ../../source/chapters/11-lazy-ai-coder.md:12
#: e0537dea84e7475abbb8b8858c6ca601
msgid ""
"Every case study so far has been *about* someone else's harness. This "
"chapter is different: it applies the three-guardian × four-zone matrix to "
"the very repository this book ships from — [`walterfan/lazy-ai-"
"coder`](https://github.com/walterfan/lazy-ai-coder) — and lands real fixes "
"on `main`. The chapter is staged as four acts."
msgstr ""
"到目前为止，每一篇案例研究都 *关于* 别人的挽具。本章不同：它把\"三大护法 × "
"四区域\"矩阵，套到本书所承载的那个仓库——[`walterfan/lazy-ai-"
"coder`](https://github.com/walterfan/lazy-ai-coder)——上，并把真正的修复合入 "
"`main`。本章以四幕剧的形式展开。"

#: ../../source/chapters/11-lazy-ai-coder.md:19
#: 7b9ecd77750c446c946253a4387b5e7c
msgid ""
"**Status.** This chapter remains `status: draft` until the Section 14 "
"commits land on the host repository's `main` branch. The book-lint script "
"walks Act 3's commit SHAs through `git cat-file -e`; until at least two "
"resolve, the chapter is excluded from the toctree. See §14.5."
msgstr ""
"**状态。** 在第 14 节的那批 commit 合入宿主仓库 `main` 分支之前，本章一直保持 `status: draft`。book-"
"lint 脚本会用 `git cat-file -e` 遍历第三幕里所列的 commit SHA；在至少两条解析成功之前，本章会被从 toctree "
"中排除。参见 §14.5。"

#: ../../source/chapters/11-lazy-ai-coder.md:25
#: 0c27534c081046e489c4fc5722bdd598
msgid "Act 1 — Audit"
msgstr "第一幕 —— 审计"

#: ../../source/chapters/11-lazy-ai-coder.md:27
#: a2555682588743e9a55edc56fefc865b
msgid ""
"The starting point is a HarnessCard capturing the repository's state as of "
"the change's start commit. Evidence for each cell is a concrete file path "
"inside the repository; the full scorecard is shipped as a hands-on artefact "
"readers can diff against."
msgstr ""
"起点是一份 HarnessCard，记录仓库在这一轮变更开始那笔 commit 时的状态。每一格的证据都是仓库内一条具体的文件路径；完整打分表以 "
"hands-on 制品形式交付，读者可与之做 diff。"

#: ../../source/chapters/11-lazy-ai-coder.md:32
#: 65d4a34086d84324bdaec4898fbf9aec
msgid ""
"<!-- verified: 2026-04-17 · Ch.11 Act 1 · Audit HarnessCard -->\n"
"\n"
"# HarnessCard — Act 1 (Audit)\n"
"\n"
"**Subject.** `walterfan/lazy-ai-coder`, starting commit SHA: `<TBD — captured at §14 landing>`.\n"
"\n"
"**Date.** 2026-04-17 (pre-fix baseline).\n"
"\n"
"**Schema version.** CAR-HarnessCard v0.2.\n"
"\n"
"| Cell            | Score | Evidence                                      |\n"
"|-----------------|-------|-----------------------------------------------|\n"
"| SDD × Bridle    | 3     | `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md` exist but drift from `openspec/`. |\n"
"| SDD × Fence     | 1     | No `make prompts-lint`; `config/prompts.yaml` unchecked.  |\n"
"| SDD × Paddock   | 2     | Review is GitHub PR default; no Verification Table.       |\n"
"| SDD × Groom     | 1     | No sources-of-truth index; docs drift silently.           |\n"
"| TDD × Bridle    | 2     | `tests/` exists but not failing-first.                    |\n"
"| TDD × Fence     | 1     | No MCP tool schema check; no secrets scan in pre-commit.  |\n"
"| TDD × Paddock   | 3     | GitHub Actions CI runs `go test` + Python tests.          |\n"
"| TDD × Groom     | 2     | Flake policy undefined; recent flakes closed ad-hoc.      |\n"
"| MDD × Bridle    | 1     | No cost dashboard; LLM spend unobservable.                |\n"
"| MDD × Fence     | 2     | Rate limits at provider only; no local cap.               |\n"
"| MDD × Paddock   | 2     | Release notes exist; no SLI gate.                         |\n"
"| MDD × Groom     | 1     | No weekly audit script.                                   |\n"
"\n"
"**SDD mean.** 1.75.  **TDD mean.** 2.0.  **MDD mean.** 1.5.\n"
"\n"
"**Overall.** 1.75. This is the pre-fix baseline; Act 4 re-scores after\n"
"the §14 fixes land.\n"
